  <heading>CFLT&lt;cc&gt; (register)</heading>
  <desc>
    <brief>
      <para>Compare registers and fault</para>
    </brief>
    <authored>
      <para>This instruction compares the values in two registers, and
generates a Conditional fault exception if the condition is true.
This instruction does not affect the condition flags.</para>
    </authored>
  </desc>
